Oil Price Prediction
This project predicts oil prices using machine learning models, trained on a time-series dataset of 2.5 million data points.

Models & Metrics:
Models Used: Linear Regression, Random Forest Regressor, XGBoost Regressor.

Best Model: XGBoost Regressor after hyperparameter tuning.

Performance:

R² Score: 0.8614

RMSE: 333,684.80 (Test Set)

MAE: 217.84 (Test Set)

Features:
Data preprocessing and feature engineering with one-hot encoding.

Hyperparameter tuning using GridSearchCV for better performance.

Requirements:
Python 3.x

Libraries: pandas, numpy, scikit-learn, xgboost, matplotlib, seaborn
